    "created_at": "2016-07-18T21:17:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T21:17:02Z",
    "body": "Looks like `data:text/html,<a href=\"data:text/html,link followed\"><form><button type=button>click me</button></form></a>`  follows the link too. So type=button shouldn't ever have action behavior defined, and type=submit and type=reset depend on whether the button is in form.\n\nDon't know about type=menu. Does any engine even support it?\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
