    "body": "type=menu is tracked in #237.\n\n[Buttons in the button state already have an activation behavior of \"Do nothing\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-button-element:activation-behaviour). Is the bug report here to be more explicit that \"Do nothing\" means \"has no activation behavior\" and thus fails to trigger the \"If target has a defined activation behavior\" clause?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
